# Courses

GET /api/courses
GET /api/courses/:id ← returns full structure with modules, lessons, quiz
POST /api/courses
POST /api/courses/:id/intro-video ← upload intro video (multipart)
PUT /api/courses/:id
DELETE /api/courses/:id

# Modules

GET /api/courses/:courseId/modules
GET /api/courses/:courseId/modules/:id
POST /api/courses/:courseId/modules
PUT /api/courses/:courseId/modules/:id
DELETE /api/courses/:courseId/modules/:id

# Lessons

GET /api/courses/:courseId/modules/:moduleId/lessons
GET /api/courses/:courseId/modules/:moduleId/lessons/:id
POST /api/courses/:courseId/modules/:moduleId/lessons/text ← create text lesson
POST /api/courses/:courseId/modules/:moduleId/lessons/video ← upload video lesson
PUT /api/courses/:courseId/modules/:moduleId/lessons/:id
DELETE /api/courses/:courseId/modules/:moduleId/lessons/:id

# Quiz (one per module)

GET /api/courses/:courseId/modules/:moduleId/quiz
POST /api/courses/:courseId/modules/:moduleId/quiz
PUT /api/courses/:courseId/modules/:moduleId/quiz
DELETE /api/courses/:courseId/modules/:moduleId/quiz

# User endpoints (requires login)

POST /api/enrollments/:courseId — enroll in a course
GET /api/enrollments/my — my enrolled courses + progress
GET /api/enrollments/:courseId/progress — my progress on a specific course
POST /api/enrollments/:courseId/lessons/:lessonId/complete — mark a lesson as complete

# Admin endpoints (requires admin token)

GET /api/enrollments/admin/all — all enrollments across all courses
GET /api/enrollments/admin/courses/:courseId — all students in a course + their progress
GET /api/enrollments/admin/users/:userId — all courses a user is enrolled in + progress
GET /api/enrollments/admin/stats — platform stats (totals, completion rate, top courses)


